    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MMK101 · Chapter 6 · Session 14</span>\n<h2>Session 14 — Principles of Marketing</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13708 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MMK101 · Chương 6 · Buổi 14</span>\n<h2>Buổi 14 — Principles of Marketing</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13708 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2,<br>CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2,<br>CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Principles of Marketing<br>Chapter 6: Business Markets and Business (cont.) Behavior<br>6.3 The Business Buyer Decision Process<br>* AI for personalization / clustering examples</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>#2.Principles of Marketing<br>Textbook, PPT presentation, and other resources if available<br>Additional reading - Read at home:<br>#2.Principles of Marketing<br>6.4 Engaging Business Buyer with Digital and Social Marketing<br>6.5 Institutional and Government Market</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Participate in discussions on how companies use data to understand customers.<br>- Practice prompt engineering (e.g., design prompts to collect marketing insights)<br>- Q&amp;A with lecturer about challenges in verifying AI-generated output<br>- Work on Coursera modules (AI for Marketing or related data analytics courses) under lecturer guidance.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
