    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MMK101 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MMK101 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Principles of Marketing</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Kotler, Philip and Armstrong, Sridhar Balasubramanian · Pearson · 2023 · 19th · ISBN <code>9781292449364</code></p><p>Chọn một trong 4 ấn bản. Ưu tiên mua ấn bản mới nhất.</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Principles of Marketing</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Kotler, Philip and Armstrong, Gary · Pearson · 2020</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Principles of Marketing</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Philip Kotler and Gary Armstrong · Pearson · 2014</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Principles of Marketing</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Kotler, Philip and Armstrong, Gary · Pearson · 2009</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Fundamentals of Management</strong></p><p>Ricky Griffin · Cengage · 2022 · 13th · ISBN <code>9781285849041</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Fundamental Accounting Principles</strong></p><p>John J. Wild, Winston Kwok, Sundar Venkatesh · McGraw Hill · 2021 · 3rd · ISBN <code>9789814923378</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/grow-with-ai-your-ai-driven-growth-marketing-strategy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/grow-with-ai-your-ai-driven-growth-marketing-strategy</a></strong></p><p>Coursera</p><p>Grow with AI: Your AI-driven Growth Marketing Strategy</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/whatcanaidoformarketing?specialization=aiformarketing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/whatcanaidoformarketing?specialization=aiformarketing</a></strong></p><p>Coursera</p><p>What Can AI Do for Marketing?</p></div>"
